      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now that we are done with this contract, what do you think this 'Zenith Initiative' was?\n\nIt sounded like a huge thing considering the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreCBill],C-Bills]] that all the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[Loretaipans],taipans]] spent trying to get it.",
