    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c74a386d74921c4e027b695"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Agreed, this was nothing than a proxy war between the 'Fox' and [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMorganHasekDavion],Morgan Hasek-Davion]], and that explains a lot how the Capellan March and the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreSyrtisFusiliers],Syrtis Fusiliers]] have so far been absent from the Davion invasion of the Capellan Confederation.\n\nAnd this might change the dynamic of the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[Lore4thSuccessionWar],Fourth Succession War]] in the future.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Perhaps this might be useful to 'Bob'?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c4f9b617118daca8e197744"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
