      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c76fb378cd8d45f8e9a22bf"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Oh for sure {COMMANDER.FirstName}, considering 'Bob's true identity as a [[DM.Factions[faction_Kurita],Kurita]] house member.\n\nThis kind of intel might be even more interesting than whatever was in that facility.",
      "branches": [
